        tabLabel: 'About',
        pages: [
          {
            title: 'Anaconda',
            subtitle: 'Pass the Trash',
            content: [
              {
                type: 'paragraph',
                text: "Anaconda, widely known in home games as 'Pass the Trash,' is a high-action poker variant characterized by multiple passing rounds and a dramatic 'rollout' showdown. Unlike traditional poker, players actively sabotage their opponents during the passing phases, making it a game of social manipulation and tactical hand-building.",
              },
              {
                type: 'paragraph',
                text: "A staple of 'Dealer's Choice' home poker games in the United States. It likely emerged in the mid-20th century as players sought to add more interaction to standard Seven-Card Stud.",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            title: 'Setup',
            subtitle: 'Table, deck, equipment, and deal',
            content: [
              {
                type: 'paragraph',
                text: "Best with 6-8 players to ensure many cards are 'trashed'.",
              },
              {
                type: 'paragraph',
                text: 'Standard 52 cards. Ace is high.',
              },
              {
                type: 'paragraph',
                text: 'Poker chips, standard deck.',
              },
              {
                type: 'paragraph',
                text: 'Each player receives 7 cards face down. Initial ante or forced bets are placed.',
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            title: 'Variations',
            subtitle: 'Known ways this game changes',
            content: [
              {
                type: 'list',
                style: 'unordered',
                items: [
                  {
                    text: 'Anaconda 8-or-Better: Pot is split between the high hand and the best low hand containing no card higher than an 8.',
                  },
                  {
                    text: 'Simple Pass the Trash: Only one round of passing (usually 3 cards) before the discard and rollout.',
                  },
                ],
              },
            ],
          },
        ],
      },
