          evolution: "The game evolved from simple 'Pass the Trash' (one pass) into 'Anaconda' (three passes) to maximize the betting rounds and the 'trash' accumulation.",
          cultural: "Often the 'wildest' game in a poker night, known for generating massive pots due to the repeated betting and the slow-burn reveal of the rollout.",
